    "license": "AGPL-3.0-only (data file). Fan implementation in original words; Risus: The Anything RPG is by S. John Ross, published by Big Dice Games.",
    "description": "Rules-light comedy engine. Characters are Cliches rated in d6 dice (10 dice at creation, max 4 in one). Write each cliche's name in its slot and set its dice in the matching rating; roll the rating's d6 pool against a target (5 easy, 10 challenging, 15 heroic, 20 superhuman, 30 impossible) or an opposed roll. Combat: both sides roll an appropriate cliche; the round's loser loses one die (three if beaten by an inappropriate cliche). At zero dice you are out of the conflict."
  },
